  <section><title>Cool Down Activity </title>
<para>For questions 1 - 4, match each equation of the linear functions with one of the lines in the given graph.</para>
<para>Match each equation of the linear functions with one of the lines in the given graph.</para>
<para><figure><media alt="Graph of four functions where the orange line has a \(y\)-intercepts at 3 and slope of 2, the baby blue line has a \(y\)-intercepts at 3 and slope of 1/2, the blue line has a \(y\)-intercepts at 3 and slope of -2, and the green line has a \(y\)-intercepts at -3 and slope of 2."><image mime-type="image/png" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/f7b53aade291d174c12865880e32db6f0bf8bb5d"/></media></figure></para>

